    {
      "id": "e2df591c-760a-47a4-adb9-44597af2ceec",
      "title": "Leia o cartão e repare no sentido de frequência alta trazido por `siempre`.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "080515b2-b3f2-4adf-ad49-237830f3e959",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Siempre</strong> indica um hábito regular.</p><p>Em <strong>Siempre desayuno en la cocina.</strong>, a ideia é: isso faz parte da rotina.</p><p>Neste tipo de frase, <strong>siempre</strong> costuma aparecer antes do verbo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0f6d53d2-afda-4160-b948-5283a26311cb",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase. Observe que a ação acontece só em alguns dias.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "be778206-d6f9-4105-b9b2-665200b19f26",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe outra frase.</p><p><strong>A veces trabajo en el salón.</strong></p><p>Em português: Às vezes eu trabalho na sala.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fdfbd7a07a164a30ad8009071d1ea680_a-veces-trabajo-en-el-salon.mp3?Expires=1794099504&Signature=sCuBcf3olKpqKmY0s9ihW7kuGCbdBV858kXiatKY0j7WrO~0eOnQjNYp2j1DjAkphrVDYupWDEOZYxRK48a3qEMiyp-SFNLwHEDt~vUXzfZ-EFh-NUmB9~Wjo3sc28mrsJTYQzmGxI28xCGBTNh3bzA0MiMPei5Ewr-lk7HqD64gnFD9iqbYUQSzFIMlm6RyVuks1cMJPAfr0M7b2z7AiN9h2M~1M411jf1uuHyWA64m7fMiy4i83fLQPMl8f~~y-ctG8RyiWZ9grsQit-jnnPE50Vijz9rwwykME5Ba9-lIQlQqXaADMaANkZOQIIHeQQav4SxrUGGda1pQ6c8VPg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
